# Placeholder only; offline fixtures do not need a key or read this file.
# Live mode reads an exported OPENROUTER_API_KEY; .env is not automatically loaded.
# The Streamlit UI reads OPENROUTER_API_KEY from an ignored .env (mode 600) or the environment.
# OPENCODE_API_KEY is never read from .env by this project; export it in your shell only if
# you want the opencode CLI to use it instead of its `opencode auth login` credentials.
# Populate only an ignored local .env or export locally; never commit or share a real key.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENCODE_API_KEY=
